sequenceDiagram
participant Planner as "allocationEngine: Service"
participant Pricing as "allocationPricingService: Service"
participant Rules as "shelfLifeDiscountService: Service"
participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
Planner->>+Pricing: priceSelectedBatchFragments(plan, timestamp)
Pricing->>+DB: Read base-price snapshot and batch expiry data
Pricing->>+Rules: resolveSkuThenCategoryRule(sku, category, hsdPercent)
Rules->>+DB: Read active rule version at pricing timestamp
DB-->>-Rules: Matching rule or no discount
Rules-->>-Pricing: Rule snapshot and reason
Pricing->>Pricing: Calculate discount amount and final unit price
Pricing->>+DB: Store batch fragment price breakdown
DB-->>-Pricing: Immutable price snapshot
Pricing-->>-Planner: Final prices per allocation fragment
Note over Pricing,DB: Price calculation occurs after MLOR eligible batch selection price does not influence scoring


